// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [callind-signature-mismatch]: indirect call disagrees with the recovered target type 'unsigned int (unsigned int)': the call site passes 0 argument(s), the type takes 1 in function 'ind_missing_arg'
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [callind-signature-mismatch]: indirect call disagrees with the recovered target type 'unsigned int (unsigned int)': argument 0 is 64-bit, the parameter is 32-bit in function 'ind_wide_arg'
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [callind-signature-mismatch]: indirect call disagrees with the recovered target type 'unsigned int (unsigned int)': the call site uses a 64-bit result, the type returns 32-bit in function 'ind_wide_return'
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [callind-signature-mismatch]: indirect call disagrees with the recovered target type 'void (unsigned int)': the call site uses a result, the type returns void in function 'ind_void_return_used'
// WARN-NOT: in function 'ind_match'
// WARN-NOT: in function 'ind_return_ignored'
// WARN-NOT: in function 'ind_untyped'
// WARN-NOT: Diag Error
//
// The call itself still follows the call site.
